{"ID":"20240206113828-r8er0nr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206113828-r8er0nr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113828-r8er0nr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113839-75v1cgp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113834-wpamehd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113839-75v1cgp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:137,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:137\u0026#125;","title":"清风藤","type":"doc","updated":"20240729160041"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113839-75v1cgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113839-75v1cgp","updated":"20240206113842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于华东、华南地区和云南。\n【性状】\t呈细长圆柱形，直径5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20mm，外表灰褐色或棕褐色，有纵皱及横向皮孔，节处膨大。体轻，质坚实而脆，易折断，断面灰黄色或淡灰棕色，不平坦。横切面韧皮部很窄，木质部导管与射线呈放射状排列，导管较大，中央为圆形的髓。气弱，味苦。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，平。\n【功效】\t祛风湿，通经络，利小便。用于风湿痹痛，关节肿胀，麻痹瘙痒。\n【注解】\t“车轮纹”：指药材断面木质部射线呈均匀的放射状排列，古亦称之为“车辐”。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113834-wpamehd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113834-wpamehd","updated":"20240206113834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113834-jt1p1x8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729153810-0c6qvuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729153810-0c6qvuj","updated":"20240729155604"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青风藤"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青风藤-20240729153901-cqjxyyp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902101932-c2a4o7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101932-c2a4o7s","updated":"20240902101932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 348px;","style":"width: 338px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤 6-20240729160243-th1dw4s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 338px;\" parent-style=\"width: 348px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 912px;","style":"width: 902px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤 8-20240729161521-r43ic4d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 902px;\" parent-style=\"width: 912px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729155609-hv7wydn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729155609-hv7wydn","updated":"20240729155743"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤 1-20240729155657-1t1f6lg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤 2-20240729155743-5wa58ak.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729155659-zc205rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729155659-zc205rt","updated":"20240729160041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 630px;","style":"width: 620px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤-20240729155604-r0pk6qn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 620px;\" parent-style=\"width: 630px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 611px;","style":"width: 601px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤 5-20240729160041-oqlak6t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 601px;\" parent-style=\"width: 611px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729154253-seyuywh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729154253-seyuywh","updated":"20240729160627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 785px;","style":"width: 775px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青风藤 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青风藤 1-20240729154253-pkilt8g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 775px;\" parent-style=\"width: 785px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"清风藤 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/清风藤 7-20240729160627-nc174hw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729154659-k3txu3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729154659-k3txu3v","updated":"20240729155624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：清风藤和青风藤是两种植物，青风藤有毒，清风藤无毒；"}]},{"ID":"20240729154304-mbn23xz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240729154304-mbn23xz"}},{"ID":"20240902101919-qc2j21c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-qc2j21c","updated":"20240902101922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中草药：清风藤"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-rya6in5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-rya6in5","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清风藤"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-fx9zuss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-fx9zuss","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】清风藤之名始见于《本草图经》，曰：“清风藤生天台山中，其苗蔓延木上，四时常有，彼土人采其叶入药，治风有效。”《纲目》与《植物名实图考》均有收录，并有附图。但从以上本草图、文所示特征难以确定为何种植物。现时植物分类学文献中所述之清风藤，均为清风藤科植物清风藤。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-16f9l1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-16f9l1i","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QīnɡFēnɡTénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-gdf1yvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-gdf1yvl","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】青藤、寻风藤、一口两嘴、过山龙、牢钩刺、一个刺二个头。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-d9k7n2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-d9k7n2h","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-84xx4vx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-84xx4vx","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为清风藤科植物清风藤的茎叶或根。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-5qartj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-5qartj7","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：SabiajaponicaMaxim."}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-8gkjlsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-8gkjlsd","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春、夏季割取藤茎，切段后，晒干；秋、冬季挖取根部，洗净，切片，鲜用或晒干。叶多在夏、秋季采收，鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-btmta7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-btmta7h","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】清风藤落叶攀援木质藤本。老枝紫褐色，常留有木质化成单刺状或双刺状的叶柄基部。单叶互生；叶柄长2-5mm，被柔毛；叶片近纸质，卵状椭圆形、卵形或阔卵形，长3.5-9cm，宽2-4.5cm，叶面中脉有稀疏毛，叶背带白色，脉上被稀疏柔毛；侧脉每边3-5条。花先叶开放，单生于叶腋，花小，两性；苞片4，倒卵形；花梗长2-4mm，果时增长至2-2.5cm；萼片5，近圆形或阔卵形，具缘毛；花瓣5，淡黄绿色，倒卵形或长圆状倒卵形，长3-4mm，具脉纹；雄蕊5；花盘杯状，有5裂齿；子房卵形，被细毛。分果片近圆形或肾形，直径约5mm；核有明显的中肋，两侧面具蜂窝状凹穴。花期2-3月，果期4-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-y0uy9no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-y0uy9no","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-2mu2p4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-2mu2p4v","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔800m以下的山谷、林缘灌木林中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-imnjllk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-imnjllk","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于江苏、安徽、浙江、江西、福建、广东、广西、贵州。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-9lppf6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-9lppf6b","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-yxq3gn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-yxq3gn2","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜阴凉湿润的气候。在雨量充沛、云雾多、土壤和空气湿度大的条件下，植株生长涟壮。要求含腐殖质多而肥沃的砂质壤土栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-hcdynma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-hcdynma","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术繁殖方法：扦插或用种子繁殖。清风藤的自然结果率不高，故多用扦插繁殖：春季，硬枝扦插，按行株距6cm×6cm斜插于土中，保持湿润。插后45-60d可定植。按行株距250cm×250cm开穴，施足基肥后选阴雨天种植。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-twsftgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-twsftgr","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别茎呈圆柱形，灰黑色，光滑，外表有纵皱纹及叶柄残基，呈短刺状。断面皮部较薄，灰黑色，木部黄白色。气微，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-uofnf4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-uofnf4b","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；辛；温"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-sad0goi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-sad0goi","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-mr3kpwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-mr3kpwg","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风利湿；活血解毒。主风湿痹痛；鹤膝风；水肿；脚气；跌打肿痛；骨折；深部脓肿；骨髓炎；化脓性关节炎；脊椎炎；疮疡肿毒；皮肤瘙痒"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-3okciyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-3okciyq","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-15g，大剂量30-60g；或浸酒。外用：适量，鲜品捣敷；或煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-ndywu7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-ndywu7a","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《植物名实图考》：“清风藤，近山处皆有之。罗思举《草药图》云：清风藤又名青藤，其木蔓延木上，四时常青。采茎用。南城具寻风藤即清风藤，蔓延屋上，土人取茎治风湿，云藤以夤缘枫树而出树梢者为真，夺枫树之精液，年深藤老，故治风有殊效，余皆无力。其藤大抵与木莲相类，厚叶木强，藤硬如木，粗可一握，黑子隆起，盖即络石一种，而所缘有异。又《本草拾遗》扶芳藤以枫树上者为佳，恐即一物。清风、扶芳，一音之转，土音大率如此。”"}]},{"ID":"20240902101919-mm0clx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101919-mm0clx8","updated":"20240902101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902101920-ydf0d95","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902101920-ydf0d95"}},{"ID":"20240902101922-pkbioiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902101922-pkbioiz"}}]}